From f553817f2ae453ab16d749138d7032cc7dd3894a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zhaosiying12138 <neucszhaopeng2016@163.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 23:43:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 41/42] vega,amdgpu: adopt cache-control MUBUFs, VOP3 i32 ops,
 and bridge re-pass

Decode and execute buffer_wbl2 and buffer_inv as no-op cache control in
the coherent host-native model, wire the VOP3-only v_add_i32/v_sub_i32
pair through shared clamp-aware value semantics, account wavefront
progress in s_sleep, and re-pass the AQL control queue when a packet
retires so a dependent dispatch is served in the same service window.

Inherited from the previous bring-up session and adopted after an
independent adversarial review confirmed the semantics against the ISA
and found only cosmetic conventions shared with existing siblings.

